  "preview": "A locksmith charges a flat call-out fee plus a per-quarter-hour rate. Given the final bill, work backward to find when the job ended — and decide whether a competitor's flat fee would have been a better deal.",
  "body": {
    "goal": "Write and solve two-step equations of the form px + q = r in a real context, interpret each part of the equation in the situation, and use the model to compare two pricing structures.",
    "studentPrompt": "Marisol locks her keys in her car at the mall. She calls Quick-Click Locksmith.\n\nQuick-Click charges a $42 call-out fee plus $9 for every 15 minutes the locksmith works on the lock.\n\nThe locksmith arrives at 6:20 p.m. and starts working immediately. When the bill prints, the total is $123.\n\n1. Write an equation that models the total bill in terms of the number of 15-minute blocks the locksmith worked. Solve it. At what time did Marisol drive away?\n2. A neighbor watching all this says, 'You should have called Bolt Brothers. They charge a flat $95 for any car lockout.' Was the neighbor right? At what bill amount would the two companies cost the same?\n3. Quick-Click is running a special: same call-out fee, but the first 15 minutes are free. Write a NEW equation for the total bill under the special. What would Marisol's bill have been?\n4. Marisol's cousin had a Quick-Click bill of $69 (no special). How long did his job take? Could the locksmith have arrived, worked, and left in under 30 minutes?",
    "image": {
      "alt": "A flat illustration of a car at night with its hazard lights on. A locksmith van with a key logo is parked nearby, and a small clock face shows 6:20.",
      "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 480 220\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"nightsky\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#1e1b4b\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#4c1d95\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"480\" height=\"160\" fill=\"url(#nightsky)\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"160\" width=\"480\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#1f2937\"/><g fill=\"#fde68a\"><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"30\" r=\"1.2\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"50\" r=\"0.8\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"25\" r=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"330\" cy=\"40\" r=\"1.2\"/><circle cx=\"410\" cy=\"20\" r=\"0.9\"/><circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"60\" r=\"1\"/></g><circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"55\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#fef3c7\" opacity=\"0.9\"/><circle cx=\"394\" cy=\"50\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#1e1b4b\"/><g transform=\"translate(70,120)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"20\" width=\"110\" height=\"35\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#dc2626\"/><path d=\"M15,20 L30,0 L80,0 L95,20 Z\" fill=\"#dc2626\"/><rect x=\"32\" y=\"4\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#a5d8ff\" opacity=\"0.6\"/><circle cx=\"25\" cy=\"55\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#111827\"/><circle cx=\"25\" cy=\"55\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#6b7280\"/><circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"55\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#111827\"/><circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"55\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#6b7280\"/><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"30\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#fbbf24\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0.2;1\" dur=\"1.2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/></circle><circle cx=\"95\" cy=\"30\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#fbbf24\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0.2;1\" dur=\"1.2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/></circle></g><g transform=\"translate(240,105)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"15\" width=\"130\" height=\"50\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#1e3a8a\"/><rect x=\"5\" y=\"20\" width=\"40\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#a5d8ff\" opacity=\"0.7\"/><circle cx=\"25\" cy=\"65\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#111827\"/><circle cx=\"25\" cy=\"65\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#9ca3af\"/><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"65\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#111827\"/><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"65\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#9ca3af\"/><g transform=\"translate(60,28)\" fill=\"#fde68a\"><circle cx=\"5\" cy=\"5\" r=\"4\"/><rect x=\"7\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"2\"/><rect x=\"22\" y=\"3\" width=\"2\" height=\"4\"/><rect x=\"18\" y=\"3\" width=\"2\" height=\"5\"/></g></g><g transform=\"translate(410,170)\"><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#f9fafb\" stroke=\"#111827\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"-9\" stroke=\"#111827\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"3\" stroke=\"#111827\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#111827\"/><text x=\"0\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#f9fafb\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6:20</text></g></svg>"
    },
    "launch": "Set the scene: 'It's a Friday night. You're in the mall parking lot. Your keys are in plain sight on the driver's seat. You have your phone, you have $130 in your bank account, and you have a decision to make.' Read the rates aloud. Send them to the boards.",
    "materials": [
      "Vertical whiteboards",
      "Markers",
      "Optional: printed receipt template"
    ],
    "concepts": [
